# MLCryptoEngine environment template
# Copy to .env and fill in. NEVER commit .env. Secrets come only from environment
# variables — the config layer (data/config.py) raises at startup if a variable
# listed under `required_secrets` in config/default.yaml is missing.
#
# Stage 1 uses PUBLIC market data only: every variable below is optional today.
# No API key with trade or withdraw permission is used or requested in Stage 1.

# --- Paths ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Root directory for recorded data. Defaults to ./data inside the repo.
# MLCE_DATA_ROOT=/var/lib/mlcryptoengine/data

# --- Kraken (Phase D+; read-only key only, never trade/withdraw scope) ---
# MLCE_KRAKEN_API_KEY=
# MLCE_KRAKEN_API_SECRET=

# --- Coinbase Advanced Trade (Phase D+; read-only key only) --------------
# MLCE_COINBASE_API_KEY=
# MLCE_COINBASE_API_SECRET=

# --- Interactive Brokers / Databento (CME micro futures, Phase B+) -------
# MLCE_DATABENTO_API_KEY=

# Helius free-tier indexer key (detection track, C.21). Read-only chain
# history; metered in credits and gated by helius_credit_cap (ADR-046).
# MLCE_HELIUS_API_KEY=

# --- Telemetry -----------------------------------------------------------
# Override probe interval in seconds (default comes from config/default.yaml)
# MLCE_TELEMETRY_INTERVAL_S=60
